<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="<%= lang || 'id' %>" data-app-theme="<%= typeof appTheme !== 'undefined' ? appTheme : 'current' %>">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>404 - Halaman Tidak Ditemukan | <%= settings.company_header || 'ZenRadius' %></title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/img/icon.png?v=<%= typeof brandVersion !== "undefined" ? brandVersion : "zenradius" %>" type="image/png">
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/unified.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/theme-tokens.css">
  <script src="/js/app-ui.js" defer></script>
  <style>
    body{
      background: var(--body-bg-solid, #101820);
      background-image: var(--body-bg-image, radial-gradient(circle at 8% 0%, #236060 0%, transparent 34%), radial-gradient(circle at 100% 100%, #173e4d 0%, transparent 42%), linear-gradient(135deg, #173740 0%, #183f51 52%, #194251 100%));
      color: var(--text, #edf7f5);
      font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 20px;
      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
    }
    .box{
      max-width: 520px;
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
      background: rgba(17, 29, 36, 0.9);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(124, 221, 218, 0.22);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 48px 32px;
      box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);
      animation: floatIn .4s cubic-bezier(.21,1.02,.73,1);
    }
    @keyframes floatIn{ from{opacity:0; transform: translateY(16px) scale(.97)} to{opacity:1; transform:none} }
    .code{font-size:88px; font-weight:800; line-height:1; font-family:'Space Grotesk','Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif; background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary,#2dd4bf), var(--accent,#22a7f0)); -webkit-background-clip:text; background-clip:text; -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent; display:inline-block}
    .ico{font-size:42px; color: var(--primary,#2dd4bf); opacity:.9}
    h1{font-size:20px; font-weight:800; margin:8px 0 6px}
    p{color: var(--muted,#a8bec2); font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; margin-bottom:24px}
    .btnx{border-radius:14px; font-weight:700; padding:12px 22px; text-decoration:none; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; transition: transform .18s, box-shadow .18s, filter .18s}
    .btnx:hover{transform: translateY(-2px); filter: brightness(1.06)}
    .btn-primary{background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary,#2dd4bf), var(--accent,#22a7f0)); color:#06121a; border:none; box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(45,212,191,.25)}
    .btn-ghost{border:1px solid rgba(190,239,255,.24); color:#e5fffc; background:rgba(190,239,255,.06); margin-inline-start:10px}
    .links{margin-top:22px; display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; justify-content:center}
    .links a{color:var(--muted,#a8bec2); font-size:12.5px; text-decoration:none; padding:6px 12px; border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.2); border-radius:999px}
    .links a:hover{color:#fff; border-color:var(--primary,#2dd4bf)}
    @media(max-width:480px){
      .code{font-size:64px}
      .btn-ghost{margin-inline-start:0; margin-top:10px}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="box">
    <div class="ico"><i class="bi bi-compass"></i></div>
    <div class="code">404</div>
    <h1>Halaman Tidak Ditemukan</h1>
    <p>Maaf, halaman yang Anda cari tidak ada, sudah dipindahkan, atau alamatnya salah.<br>Silakan periksa kembali atau kembali ke halaman utama.</p>
    <a href="/" class="btnx btn-primary"><i class="bi bi-house-door"></i> Kembali ke Beranda</a>
    <a href="/pelanggan/login" class="btnx btn-ghost"><i class="bi bi-person-circle"></i> Login Pelanggan</a>
    <div class="links">
      <a href="/admin/login">Admin</a>
      <a href="/teknisi/login">Teknisi</a>
      <a href="/mitra/login">Mitra</a>
      <a href="/penagih/login">Penagih</a>
      <a href="/voucher">Beli Voucher</a>
      <a href="/cek-tagihan">Cek Tagihan</a>
      <a href="/daftar">Daftar Berlangganan</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>